8069:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Configures the TIMx External Trigger (ETR).
8070:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIMx to select the TIM peripheral
8071:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ExtTRGPrescaler The external Trigger Prescaler.
8072:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
8073:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPRESCALER_DIV1: ETRP Prescaler OFF.
8074:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPRESCALER_DIV2: ETRP frequency divided by 2.
8075:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPRESCALER_DIV4: ETRP frequency divided by 4.
8076:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPRESCALER_DIV8: ETRP frequency divided by 8.
8077:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ExtTRGPolarity The external Trigger Polarity.
8078:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
8079:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPOLARITY_INVERTED: active low or falling edge active.
8080:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPOLARITY_NONINVERTED: active high or rising edge active.
8081:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  ExtTRGFilter External Trigger Filter.
8082:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter must be a value between 0x00 and 0x0F
8083:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @retval None
8084:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   */
